# Copy to .env (or .env.local for machine-specific overrides).
# VITE_* values are embedded in the JS bundle — never put secrets here.
#
# /api is proxied to the real API by the dev server (see vite.config.ts) so
# the HttpOnly auth cookies are first-party. In production point this at the
# same-site API origin (https) or keep a same-origin path behind the domain.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
